title: Scenes
description: Reusable shots — intro, chapter, quote, stat, list, versus, device, route, outro — and the 9:16 story cut. Each is an arrangement of layers that already exist; fill it with placeholders and it is a template.
eyebrow: Content creation · Elements
source: src/studio/scene.css
