<p>A scene is a frame with a job. <code>im-studio-scene</code> gives it a head row (the mark, a chip), a stage and a foot row (a mono line each side); the modifier gives the stage its grid. Everything on the stage is a layer with a time, so a scene is already a clip: open any of these and it plays.</p>

