<h2>Using one</h2>
<p>Copy the frame’s page, keep the classes, change the words and the pictures, and the times if the voice-over needs them. The placeholders are the fixtures (<code>demo.shots</code>, <code>demo.me</code>); a theme points them at its own. Export with <code>npm run frames scene-</code>.</p>
